What you are looking at

Columns
  ready     removable now: a rule is on and every guard passed
  optional  removable only if you pick it (a rule that is switched off)
  kept      protected: a guard keeps it (open files, unsaved work, ...)
  place     the folder or tool cache the rows belong to
  In the flat list the source column says the same: auto = ready.

Markers
  [ ] not selected   [x] selected   [~] some rows of a place selected
  [-] nothing here can be selected
  The box of a place counts every row you can select in it, ready or
  optional: [x] only when all of them are selected.

Keys
  enter  open a place, or show the details of a row
  space  select a row; on a place: select its ready rows. A place with
         only optional rows asks first: y selects them, n or esc not.
         With ready and optional rows, space takes the ready ones only
         (the box stays [~], never [x]); pick the optional ones with enter
  a      places: select the ready rows of the places in view
         inside a place: its ready rows; flat list: every row in view
lines 1-23 of 36 | up/down scroll | esc or ? close | q quit
